# Task 147-019 Execution Plan

## Objective
Write 41+ integration tests across 5 files in tests/nervous/integration/

## Files to Create
1. tests/nervous/integration/observer-to-detector.test.ts (10 tests)
2. tests/nervous/integration/detector-to-decision.test.ts (10 tests)
3. tests/nervous/integration/proposer-to-executor.test.ts (10 tests)
4. tests/nervous/integration/dispatcher-end-to-end.test.ts (6 tests)
5. tests/nervous/integration/regression-sprint-146.test.ts (5 tests)

## Approach
- Mock filesystem and external I/O at boundaries
- Use real module instances (no mocking code under test)
- Test full pipeline flows: Observer event → Detector → DecisionEngine → Proposer → Executor → Dispatcher
- Use vi.useFakeTimers for timeout-dependent tests
- Replay Sprint 146 real-world scenarios (string; corruption, test-writer anomaly)

